  ('5b5add39-54a3-50d5-a694-8d7163f93bd1', 24, 'Day 24 — coming soon', '', '', '[]'::jsonb, 'What did you do today, and what did you notice?', 0, false),
  ('0cf63e3a-f5f9-5b2f-aa36-0874ae4318cd', 1, 'Go one day without criticising', 'Criticism rarely changes anyone — it puts people on the defensive and makes them justify themselves. People respond far better to being understood than to being corrected. Holding back a complaint is the first people-skill, and the hardest.', 'How to Win Friends and Influence People — Dale Carnegie', '["From now until you sleep: no criticising, condemning or complaining about anyone.","When you catch the urge, pause and ask: ''Why might they have done that?''","Keep a tally of how many times you caught yourself."]'::jsonb, 'How many times did you catch yourself, and what was the hardest moment to stay quiet?', 0, true),
  ('0cf63e3a-f5f9-5b2f-aa36-0874ae4318cd', 2, 'Give one honest, specific compliment', 'Almost everyone is hungry to feel appreciated, and sincere appreciation is different from flattery because it is specific and true. Noticing what someone did well — and saying it — costs nothing and is remembered for a long time.', 'How to Win Friends and Influence People — Dale Carnegie', '["Pick one person you''ll see or message today.","Find something they genuinely did well. Be specific.","Tell them, without asking for anything afterwards."]'::jsonb, 'Who did you appreciate, what exactly did you say, and how did they react?', 0, true),
  ('0cf63e3a-f5f9-5b2f-aa36-0874ae4318cd', 3, 'Ask, then listen for two minutes', 'The way to be interesting is to be interested. People enjoy talking with someone who is curious about them, and you learn far more by asking than by telling. Real attention is rare enough to feel like a gift.', 'How to Win Friends and Influence People — Dale Carnegie', '["In one conversation today, ask a question about something the other person cares about.","Listen for two full minutes without bringing it back to yourself.","Ask one follow-up question based on what they said."]'::jsonb, 'What did you ask, and what did you learn that you didn''t know before?', 0, true),
  ('0cf63e3a-f5f9-5b2f-aa36-0874ae4318cd', 4, 'Day 4 — coming soon', '', '', '[]'::jsonb, 'What did you do today, and what did you notice?', 0, false),
